---
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<footer class="bg-[#c84b11] text-[#f4f1ea]">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="px-5 pb-16 pt-24 md:col-span-3 md:px-8 md:pt-28">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,9vw,6rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-tight">
        <span data-lang="es">Hablemos</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Let’s talk</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-10 max-w-[34rem] font-serif text-[clamp(1.45rem,2vw,1.85rem)] leading-[1.35]">
        <span data-lang="es">
          Si buscas un desarrollador para tu equipo o tienes una oportunidad laboral, <button type="button" class="copy-link" data-copy-email>copia mi correo directo</button> o <a class="footer-link" data-lang="es" href="/cv-es.pdf" download>descarga mi CV en PDF</a>.
        </span>
        <span data-lang="en">
          If you are hiring a developer, or you have a role in mind, <button type="button" class="copy-link" data-copy-email>copy my email</button> or <a class="footer-link" href="/cv-en.pdf" download>download my CV as a PDF</a>.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6 px-5 pb-10 md:px-8">
    <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em]" aria-label="Contacto">
      <a class="footer-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email</a>
      <a class="footer-link" href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      {
        site.linkedin && (
          <a class="footer-link" href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            LinkedIn
          </a>
        )
      }
    </nav>
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#fff8f2]">
      <span data-metric></span>
      <kbd>Ctrl + K</kbd>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
